# v1.6.1 (S16.1, decision 59): Russian, Ukrainian and Greek layouts; AltGr = US layer.
copy-notes tests/test-notes/_test
usb plug
tap-on Options
tap-on Keyboard & input
tap-on Layout
page next
shot v1.6.1-layout-choices-page2
tap-on Russian
expect-setting layout=ru
esc
esc
usb-type Съешь же ещё этих мягких булок, № 5
expect Съешь же ещё этих мягких булок, № 5
usb-type  # [[Note]]
expect # [[Note]]
type привет
expect привет
shot v1.6.1-full-russian
key Alt
shot v1.6.1-full-russian-altgr
key Alt
key Compact
shot v1.6.1-compact-russian
key Shift
shot v1.6.1-compact-russian-shift
key Shift
key Full
tap-on Options
tap-on Keyboard & input
tap-on Layout
page next
tap-on Ukrainian
expect-setting layout=ua
esc
esc
usb-type Ґанок, їжак, єнот, Іван: ₴ 10
expect Ґанок, їжак, єнот, Іван: ₴ 10
shot v1.6.1-full-ukrainian
tap-on Options
tap-on Keyboard & input
tap-on Layout
page next
tap-on Greek
expect-setting layout=gr
esc
esc
usb-type Καλημέρα, ψυχή! Ϊ ϋ ά
expect Καλημέρα, ψυχή! Ϊ ϋ ά
shot v1.6.1-full-greek
key Compact
shot v1.6.1-compact-greek
key Full
tap-on Options
tap-on Display
tap-on Orientation/Landscape
tap-on Back
tap-on Keyboard & input
tap-on Layout
page next
page next
shot v1.6.1-landscape-layout-choices-page3
tap-on Ukrainian
expect-setting layout=ua
esc
esc
shot v1.6.1-landscape-full-ukrainian
key Compact
shot v1.6.1-landscape-compact-ukrainian
key Full
